.TH okf-jawn-purge_workspace 1  "purge_workspace " 
.SH NAME
okf\-jawn\-purge_workspace \- Permanently remove a workspace\*(Aqs originals, derivatives, index entries, history, managed backups and retained exports, and mark what referred to them invalidated. Never claims to erase copies outside the application. Tenant administrator in a human session only; repeating the request resumes an unfinished purge.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBokf\-jawn purge_workspace\fR [\fB\-\-server\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Permanently remove a workspace\*(Aqs originals, derivatives, index entries, history, managed backups and retained exports, and mark what referred to them invalidated. Never claims to erase copies outside the application. Tenant administrator in a human session only; repeating the request resumes an unfinished purge.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR [default: http://127.0.0.1:7711]

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR [default: {}]
JSON request, @file, or \- for stdin
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
